Package: heckle
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11)
Description: Generate modular Terraform or OpenTofu from existing software forges
 Inventories GitHub organizations, GitLab groups, Gitea and Forgejo organizations
 and generates standalone Terraform or OpenTofu configuration using native provider mappings.
 Coverage is provider-specific. Terraform or OpenTofu is required for generation and validation
 but not for inventory discovery or reading saved coverage reports.
